## User Stories

* As a user, I should be able to create a new bank account.

* As a customer, I should be able to perform basic banking operations such as deposit, withdraw, and transfer money.

* As a customer, I should be able to check my account balance.

* As a banker, I should be able to display all customers and their accounts.

* As a banker, I should be able to activate and deactivate customer accounts.
